⨯ union-key: union discriminator for 'MultiViolations' cannot be @optional
  @ test.idl:2:31

 2 │ union MultiViolations switch(@optional long) {
   │                               ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ @optional not allowed on discriminator
 3 │ case 1:
 4 │     @key string first;

  ? remove @optional from the discriminator
  * union discriminators must always be present

⨯ union-key: union variant 'first' cannot use @key
  @ test.idl:4:6

 2 │ union MultiViolations switch(@optional long) {
 3 │ case 1:
 4 │     @key string first;
   │      ˆˆˆ @key not allowed on union variant
 5 │ case 2:
 6 │     @key long second;

  ? remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
  * only the union discriminator can be marked as @key

⨯ union-key: union variant 'second' cannot use @key
  @ test.idl:6:6

 4 │     @key string first;
 5 │ case 2:
 6 │     @key long second;
   │      ˆˆˆ @key not allowed on union variant
 7 │ };

  ? remove @key from the variant or move it to the discriminator
